300 final answers from the same briefs as 11_retyping,
with the figure filled in by code

  exact                                  299
  the quarter-before field                 1
  a different finding                      0
  no slot, or a number written anyway      0

  wanted F1 value; the model chose F1 value_quarter_before

Every figure that reached an answer is exactly a warehouse value: retyping is
gone by construction. Choosing which value is still the model's job, and its
errors are still possible, now visible as a field that can be checked.
